5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure the new system actually works on the floor. I'll look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm concerned about the long-term financial commitment. I'll check the board minutes on capital and operating requests and the five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know why our previous projects failed to stay aligned with the business. I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see if things just get old or if outside help makes a mess! I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I shall focus on the human element of this transition. I will look into administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Kenji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since everyone has already selected their two areas of investigation, I believe we have a comprehensive list. I am satisfied with my choices.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. We have covered the technical, financial, and human aspects of the operation. I have nothing to add.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,Me neither! I'm just super excited to see what we find out. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. It is wise to examine the foundations before we build the house. I am content with our selections.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
